[I] Korean Hangul input method library

[T] libhangul implements Hangul input method logic, a hanja (Chinese character)
[T] dictionary, and Hangul character classification, and is used by ibus-hangul
[T] and other input frameworks to provide Korean text input.

[U] https://github.com/libhangul/libhangul

